tlessness and excitement, both teams are determined to come out on top in the third season of Haikyuu!!.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["ハイキュー!! 烏野高校 VS 白鳥沢学園高校",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-24198":"2020-03-29T13:10:02Z","serial-22630":"2020-02-09T13:33:19Z","serial-22049":"2020-01-30T23:46:39Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-24198","serial-22630","serial-22049"],"relatedMalIds":[28891,40262],"availableEpisodeCount":10,"rating":8.77,"relations":[{"id":28891,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":40262,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}